04:19.040 --> 04:21.380
I lost two or three cylinders!
On the backstretch!

04:22.380 --> 04:25.380
'Cuz you keep redlining, dipshit!

04:26.790 --> 04:28.040
It's Rob!

04:29.500 --> 04:31.000
Over here!

04:31.000 --> 04:32.790
Be careful!

04:38.920 --> 04:41.330
Look! The valve's punched right though the piston!

04:41.960 --> 04:43.420
Looks awful!

04:48.460 --> 04:49.670
Damn it!

04:49.830 --> 04:52.290
What's that? What happened to Hiro?!

04:55.670 --> 04:56.750
8 mm impact socket!

04:56.750 --> 04:57.500
Yes, sir!

04:57.500 --> 04:59.880
Now gimme a #10 spark plug
and a Phillips screwdriver!

05:00.580 --> 05:02.710
Dammit, my engine!

05:02.710 --> 05:04.630
There, there, don't cry.

05:04.630 --> 05:07.040
I've tuned it for low end torque.

05:07.630 --> 05:09.920
So keep it 10% below redline, y'hear?!

05:10.250 --> 05:11.460
Got it!

05:13.330 --> 05:15.420
What kept you, Maggie?
You're late!

05:15.420 --> 05:20.130
Well, I can't just leave the advanced
nursing class early, you know!

05:24.750 --> 05:26.330
The gyro timing's out of whack.

05:26.330 --> 05:29.170
It'll wobble some, so it's up to you
to keep her balanced!

05:31.830 --> 05:33.170
C'mon, you acrobat!

05:33.170 --> 05:34.460
You'd better not crash!

05:34.460 --> 05:36.750
Don't do anything too crazy!

05:41.460 --> 05:45.130
Oh, looks like we've got an accident at the third turn.

05:45.130 --> 05:46.420
Just look at all that smoke.

05:46.420 --> 05:48.380
The rescue team's checking it out.

05:48.380 --> 05:51.210
This is looking to be one killer race, folks!

05:51.210 --> 05:53.080
The heat's really on now!

05:54.130 --> 05:55.790
The game's moving into the latter half.

05:55.790 --> 06:00.130
In the lead are the Killer Commandoes,
ahead at the moment by fifteen points.

06:00.130 --> 06:01.420
But will they keep it up?

06:01.420 --> 06:05.210
Their head scorer, #7 "Kamikaze Commander" Hiro

06:05.210 --> 06:08.080
burned his engine out in a clash on the backstretch
and is out of the game for now!

06:08.080 --> 06:09.460
burned his engine out in a clash on the backstretch
and is out of the game for now!

06:08.080 --> 06:09.460
Let's see...

06:09.790 --> 06:12.170
The Barbarians have a shot to turn the tide!

06:10.920 --> 06:12.170
Dry martini...

06:12.170 --> 06:12.630
The odds are now 12:4.

06:12.630 --> 06:14.250
With a Mediterranean olive, please.

06:14.250 --> 06:16.500
Now's the time to man up and place your bets!

06:16.500 --> 06:19.750
Call us right away! Our lines are still open!

06:19.880 --> 06:22.750
This is an underground bar.

06:20.880 --> 06:22.750
Here they come, here they come!

06:22.750 --> 06:25.040
Who's heading the sixteenth lap?!

06:22.750 --> 06:25.040
We don't carry any of that proper stuff here.

06:25.040 --> 06:26.830
A Killer, a Killer! It's a Killer Commando!

06:26.830 --> 06:27.580
It's #2, "The Speed Racer" Jack!

06:27.580 --> 06:29.580
Are you the informant?

06:29.710 --> 06:32.580
The Killer Commandoes have won three laps in a row now!

06:32.580 --> 06:35.420
The Commandoes are on fire today!

06:32.580 --> 06:35.420
Well, yeah, among other things...

06:35.420 --> 06:38.170
The Killer Commandoes are serious about this race...

06:35.420 --> 06:39.290
But anyway, welcome to war on Venus
all the way from peaceful Earth.

06:38.170 --> 06:40.710
having vowed to start fresh and advance onto the next level.

06:39.290 --> 06:40.710
Why, thank you.

06:40.710 --> 06:41.670
having vowed to start fresh and advance onto the next level.

06:41.880 --> 06:43.460
Now one by one, their racers are finishing up their laps!

06:43.460 --> 06:46.460
That's bitter! What the heck?!

06:46.460 --> 06:48.460
That's another two points for them!

06:46.460 --> 06:48.460
An acclimatizer.

06:48.460 --> 06:51.040
After three months traveling through space and
changes in air pressure and atmosphere,

06:49.330 --> 06:51.040
They've pulled ahead again.

06:51.040 --> 06:53.250
The odds are getting closer now!

06:51.040 --> 06:53.250
I thought you must be tired.

06:53.580 --> 06:55.380
We're still taking calls!

06:55.380 --> 06:57.880
If you're watching this in front of a TV now,

06:57.880 --> 06:59.880
place your bets by phone!

06:57.880 --> 06:59.880
Here's your order.

07:02.080 --> 07:03.210
Jeez...

07:03.210 --> 07:06.880
Excitement is at its peak now in this special stadium in Io.

07:03.210 --> 07:06.880
After I brought the newest model
all the way from Earth, too.

07:06.880 --> 07:09.380
This is what you want in the B-level races.

07:06.880 --> 07:09.380
And this is a gift from your predecessor.

07:09.380 --> 07:12.290
You'd never see this much reckless driving at the A-levels!

07:12.290 --> 07:13.500
What's this?

07:13.630 --> 07:16.380
It's the kind of game you can't see elsewhere,

07:13.630 --> 07:15.460
It came with a message:

07:15.460 --> 07:17.880
"Don't use it if you hope to get home alive."

07:16.380 --> 07:19.420
and here it is, right here, in this very stadium!

07:17.880 --> 07:19.420
Do you need anything else?

07:19.420 --> 07:21.460
and here it is, right here, in this very stadium!

07:22.790 --> 07:24.500
Can I get an actual martini?

07:23.380 --> 07:27.670
The Killer Commandoes are really on a roll today!

07:24.500 --> 07:25.460
Sure thing.

07:25.460 --> 07:27.670
Also, what's that on TV?

07:27.830 --> 07:29.290
Whoa!

07:29.290 --> 07:34.420
Coming around the back corner is the queen from the Barbarians!

07:29.290 --> 07:30.920
It's a battlebike game.

07:30.920 --> 07:32.130
Wanna place a bet?

07:32.130 --> 07:34.420
The Killer Commandoes versus the Venus Barbarians.

07:34.420 --> 07:35.250
And following close behind comes #7!

07:35.250 --> 07:36.790
They're both a bunch of B-level kids,

07:36.790 --> 07:40.250
It's #7! Yes, yes, It's him!

07:36.790 --> 07:40.250
but the gamblers really like 'em that way.

07:40.790 --> 07:41.330
What a surprise! He's back after missing just a lap!

07:41.330 --> 07:44.040
The teams start at the same time
with half a lap between them.

07:44.040 --> 07:45.880
You get one point for lapping an opponent.

07:45.880 --> 07:46.420
He's coming up fast behind the Barbarian's queen vehicle.

07:46.420 --> 07:51.960
He's coming up fast behind the Barbarian's queen vehicle.

07:46.420 --> 07:49.750
Three points if you lap the rival team's leader.

07:49.750 --> 07:55.290
You get scored on laps won and rival bikes destroyed.

07:51.960 --> 07:55.290
The queen is issuing commands.

07:55.500 --> 07:56.710
Will this be another lap for them?!

07:55.500 --> 07:56.710
Why not make a wager?

07:57.580 --> 07:59.790
You'll still make the last round of bets.

08:00.880 --> 08:02.080
An accident!

08:02.920 --> 08:04.540
That's one crash there.

08:05.000 --> 08:06.920
A pretty tame one, too.

08:12.250 --> 08:15.290
Yokubou sae

08:12.250 --> 08:15.290
Be it desire

08:15.290 --> 08:18.000
Zetsubou sae

08:15.290 --> 08:18.000
Be it despair

08:15.500 --> 08:16.710
Hiro here!

08:16.710 --> 08:18.000
I'm on their queen's tail!

08:18.500 --> 08:22.330
Shiranaimama ja

08:18.500 --> 08:22.330
If you haven't experienced it

08:18.500 --> 08:20.540
Hiro, slow down!

08:20.540 --> 08:22.330
You'll overrev it again!

08:23.130 --> 08:25.420
Miranda's seriously pissed!

08:24.460 --> 08:30.540
Kako to mirai tsunagu hazu no

08:24.460 --> 08:30.540
You'll never see the present

08:25.420 --> 08:26.670
Y'hear?!

08:30.540 --> 08:34.290
Ima ga mienai

08:30.540 --> 08:34.290
That ties the past and future together

08:36.000 --> 08:40.880
Fukaku sumisugiteru

08:36.000 --> 08:40.880
Deep and far too crystal clear

08:41.210 --> 08:46.960
Sono hitomi wa dokomademo

08:41.210 --> 08:46.960
Your eyes are infinitely so

08:47.670 --> 08:49.500
What do you hound on?

08:50.460 --> 08:53.580
Butsukeru mono mo nai

08:50.460 --> 08:53.580
You have nothing to strike with

08:54.170 --> 08:57.040
Samayou kokoro o chigitte

08:54.170 --> 08:57.040
Tear up your wandering soul and

08:57.040 --> 09:00.210
Ride & Crush

09:00.210 --> 09:03.790
Crush & Ride

09:03.790 --> 09:08.460
Hashirinukeru

09:03.790 --> 09:08.460
Keep riding through

09:09.710 --> 09:15.330
Hashirinukeru

09:09.710 --> 09:15.330
Keep riding through

09:20.500 --> 09:22.000
What an intense crash!

09:22.000 --> 09:23.080
They've flung themselves over the barriers, diving into the ravine!

09:23.080 --> 09:25.040
Does that happen a lot, too?

09:25.040 --> 09:27.580
It's for the fans, I guess.

09:27.790 --> 09:29.330
Hmm, are they going to be all right?

09:27.790 --> 09:29.330
They're crazy!

09:29.330 --> 09:29.880
Hmm, are they going to be all right?

09:29.880 --> 09:32.210
The crowd in the front bleachers are on their feet,

09:32.210 --> 09:32.880
clamoring for a look!

09:32.880 --> 09:36.790
Back on Earth, they'd shut down such
a barbaric game in a heartbeat!

09:34.000 --> 09:36.790
And who's this?! It's Hiro!

09:36.790 --> 09:38.670
Hiro, Hiro, coming down the stretch!

09:36.790 --> 09:39.380
Well, if they didn't do this, those kids would-

09:38.670 --> 09:42.130
Just listen to those cheers, that whistling!

09:39.380 --> 09:40.920
Oh, care for another glass?

09:40.920 --> 09:42.130
No thanks.

09:42.130 --> 09:43.210
The crowd's on fire!

09:43.330 --> 09:45.880
So what are the Barbarians going to do now?!

09:44.670 --> 09:45.880
Let me pay with these.

09:45.880 --> 09:49.040
So what are the Barbarians going to do now?!

09:49.040 --> 09:50.710
If you look at the far end,

09:49.040 --> 09:50.710
Let me get you some change.

09:50.710 --> 09:52.630
there's a pack of them bringing up the rear!

09:50.710 --> 09:52.630
Forget the change.

09:52.630 --> 09:55.920
A whole bunch of them are crowded together,

09:52.630 --> 09:55.920
Just give me the latest war gossip, 'kay?

09:55.920 --> 09:57.540
and they're flooding onto the stretch!

09:57.670 --> 10:01.210
Every last one of them!

09:57.670 --> 09:59.420
I'll give you a real juicy one,

09:59.420 --> 10:01.210
to celebrate your placement here.

10:02.000 --> 10:03.670
It's an all-out race between the two now!

10:03.670 --> 10:05.880
You know the conflict over Tyrus Island?

10:05.880 --> 10:08.040
That's done and over with.

10:08.250 --> 10:09.960
Aphrodia got crushed.

10:10.790 --> 10:12.250
There they go, there they go!

10:12.250 --> 10:16.540
I hear Ishtar's already invading Malthulias as we speak.

10:16.540 --> 10:20.080
Wow! That means all-out war!

10:20.080 --> 10:21.750
Don't act so happy!

10:21.750 --> 10:23.630
Sorry, go on!

10:23.630 --> 10:27.250
Pretty soon, they might even invade Io, too!

10:29.960 --> 10:31.170
What the hell?!

10:31.170 --> 10:32.580
It was just getting good!

10:36.380 --> 10:38.080
What's that sound?

10:41.170 --> 10:42.500
An air raid!

10:55.250 --> 10:56.460
Did you see that?!

10:56.460 --> 11:00.170
Thanks for the info, but get to the point
faster next time, 'kay?!

11:55.960 --> 11:56.960
What is that?!

11:56.960 --> 11:57.960
They're huge!

11:57.960 --> 11:59.080
What the hell?!

11:59.080 --> 12:00.500
We were winning, for crying out loud!

12:44.080 --> 12:45.500
This ain't good.

12:45.880 --> 12:47.880
They dropped a ton of stuff.

12:48.880 --> 12:50.080
Miranda!

12:50.080 --> 12:52.880
Will, you take these kids in your buggy.

12:53.170 --> 12:56.380
Load all the monobikes and junk
on the old man's carrier!

12:56.790 --> 12:58.040
Let's make a break for it!

12:58.670 --> 13:00.500
Hiro! Hiro, don't!

13:00.500 --> 13:02.170
Are you insane?!

13:36.080 --> 13:37.420
What a mess.

13:39.330 --> 13:41.830
Miranda, Route 1's no good.

13:41.830 --> 13:43.080
We can't get out that way!

13:43.630 --> 13:45.080
Go out the rear of the stadium!

13:45.420 --> 13:47.080
We can get to town on the back roads!

13:54.580 --> 13:56.290
Security HQ! Security HQ!

13:56.830 --> 13:58.000
What's attacking?!

13:58.000 --> 13:59.790
I dunno, but they're huge!

13:59.790 --> 14:01.290
We've got three of them in the Aztec District!

14:01.290 --> 14:02.710
We need backup!

14:14.380 --> 14:16.540
Hiro, we're at war, you hear?

14:16.540 --> 14:17.750
Where the hell are you?!

14:17.750 --> 14:19.330
You're making Maggie cry, you dolt!

14:19.880 --> 14:21.080
Oh, shut up!

14:53.250 --> 14:55.500
They're breaking into the Tacoma District!

14:56.000 --> 14:57.460
Fire the missiles, quick!

15:31.670 --> 15:33.540
Wow, what a great angle!

15:33.540 --> 15:34.880
Fire away!

15:41.540 --> 15:44.830
Amazing! This is the real deal!

15:59.580 --> 16:01.920
Idiots! What're you shooting at?!

16:11.040 --> 16:12.920
Great, great!

16:16.000 --> 16:17.000
Sorry!

16:17.000 --> 16:18.960
Hey! Keep your eyes on the road, you-

16:20.670 --> 16:21.960
Actually, this is perfect!

16:21.960 --> 16:23.500
Give me a lift, won't you?

16:23.500 --> 16:24.920
You want to get in?

16:24.920 --> 16:27.170
Well, if we weren't in such a mess...

16:27.170 --> 16:29.920
You've gotta support the freedom of the press!

16:30.790 --> 16:32.170
Whatever that means.

16:39.210 --> 16:45.170
March 7th, Venus Year 072

16:45.170 --> 16:49.830
The Ishtar Army's 101st Airborne Brigade...

16:52.460 --> 16:56.750
...launched a surprise attack on Io,

16:52.460 --> 16:56.750
the capital of Aphrodia.

17:15.580 --> 17:19.000
We ask that citizens remain calm and follow our instructions.

17:19.330 --> 17:22.500
All active combat has ceased throughout the capital.

17:23.670 --> 17:24.880
I repeat:

17:24.880 --> 17:26.210
We ask that citizens remain calm and follow our instructions.

17:26.210 --> 17:29.380
Look, I've told you a dozen times already!

17:28.500 --> 17:29.380
All active combat has ceased throughout the capital.

17:29.380 --> 17:32.750
Hey! Turn off that lousy channel, will you?!

17:33.000 --> 17:34.710
Roads and railways are operating as normal.

17:34.710 --> 17:35.460
Roads and railways are operating as normal.

17:34.710 --> 17:38.330
This is the number for the Venus bureau of
the Independent Press, isn't it?!

17:35.460 --> 17:38.330
Most shops in the city are opening for business.

17:38.540 --> 17:39.670
Everyone's out?!

17:39.670 --> 17:42.830
It's as if yesterday's hostilities didn't even happen.

17:40.500 --> 17:42.830
Then who the hell are you?!

17:43.250 --> 17:44.250
We are already seeing members of the Security Force

17:43.250 --> 17:44.250
Hey, wait!

17:44.250 --> 17:44.960
We are already seeing members of the Security Force

17:44.960 --> 17:47.330
Give it up, girlie.

17:45.460 --> 17:49.330
fraternizing peacefully with Ishutar soldiers.

17:47.330 --> 17:49.330
My name is Susan Sommers!

17:50.080 --> 17:51.290
Damn!

17:51.830 --> 17:54.210
Did'ja know? They call it the "Octopus"!

17:54.210 --> 17:57.460
Its real name is the Admiral A-1 tank, actually.

17:58.670 --> 18:00.420
Man, it's crazy strong!

18:00.790 --> 18:03.000
Yes! They're white!

18:04.130 --> 18:06.580
I was sure they'd be beige!

18:07.920 --> 18:08.960
Go figure.

18:08.960 --> 18:10.960
Yup, she's less racy than she looks.

18:10.960 --> 18:13.080
Sheesh, you totally called it!

18:13.080 --> 18:15.170
Sorry guys! You all owe me now.

18:15.920 --> 18:17.420
What's this stupid game?!

18:17.420 --> 18:19.130
At my expense, too!

18:19.130 --> 18:20.130
Jeez!

18:22.880 --> 18:24.330
You got some great footage there.

18:24.330 --> 18:25.540
Well, sure.

18:26.000 --> 18:27.250
I'm a pro!

18:31.040 --> 18:33.710
Jeez! What's with all the noise?

18:34.630 --> 18:35.830
Where's Hiro?

18:36.080 --> 18:37.290
Out to get groceries.

18:37.290 --> 18:38.880
Along with Maggie!

18:48.880 --> 18:50.290
Hiro!

18:51.420 --> 18:52.830
These are so heavy!

18:53.420 --> 18:54.880
Give me a hand!

18:55.630 --> 18:59.500
No matter the situation,
you women always love to shop, huh?

18:59.500 --> 19:00.920
Don't give me that!

19:01.500 --> 19:03.460
Don't you realize this is an emergency?

19:03.790 --> 19:06.170
We've got to stockpile supplies early!

19:06.170 --> 19:08.500
You'd make a good housewife, I guess.

19:09.580 --> 19:10.790
What's that?!

19:11.750 --> 19:13.880
It's not all gonna fit.

19:13.880 --> 19:15.790
This thing's really all flash, huh?

19:16.130 --> 19:17.830
Save your complaints for Rob.

19:17.830 --> 19:19.460
It's his car!

19:21.630 --> 19:22.920
Why not get your folks to buy one?

19:22.920 --> 19:24.330
They're rich, right?

19:26.130 --> 19:28.580
Hey! Don't be so reckless!

19:30.420 --> 19:32.250
There are soldiers out on patrol, you know!

19:32.920 --> 19:34.420
You'll get us shot to death!

19:37.380 --> 19:38.580
ID!

19:38.580 --> 19:39.790
"ID"?

19:40.670 --> 19:41.880
Here.

19:48.710 --> 19:50.540
So, wanna go?

19:51.540 --> 19:52.830
There again?

19:53.540 --> 19:56.040
Yeah! I bet they'll have sales going on today!

19:56.630 --> 19:58.380
C'mon, gimme a break.

19:58.380 --> 20:00.580
Please? Just for a bit! Promise!

20:00.580 --> 20:02.330
I really hate places like that, okay?!

20:03.500 --> 20:04.920
You don't have to yell...

20:06.750 --> 20:08.000
Oh, fine!

20:19.040 --> 20:21.880
Jeez, you have such a colonial mentality!

20:22.790 --> 20:24.420
Maybe, but who cares?

20:25.710 --> 20:27.750
The authorities didn't do this, you know.

20:27.750 --> 20:30.210
A ton of people came together to make this.

20:30.500 --> 20:31.920
We want blue skies!

20:31.920 --> 20:34.750
Nature and clean water and flowers and birds...

20:34.750 --> 20:35.960
All of it!

20:36.380 --> 20:38.210
Everyone feels that way, so-

20:54.330 --> 20:55.960
I think we should go.

20:57.460 --> 20:58.670
No!

20:58.670 --> 21:00.420
I hate this war!

21:01.710 --> 21:02.920
C'mon.

21:05.330 --> 21:07.330
This just in:

21:07.630 --> 21:10.880
Brigade General Gerhard Donner,
Commander in Chief of the Ishutar Occupation Forces,

21:10.880 --> 21:13.210
made a courtesy call on the mayor today,

21:13.210 --> 21:17.670
where he made it clear that the forces would
fully cooperate to ensure citizen safety.

21:18.040 --> 21:20.500
What the hell did you lot come here for?!

21:18.040 --> 21:22.210
In light of this, city authorities have deployed
police forces throughout the city,

21:20.500 --> 21:22.210
Go back to your country already!

21:22.210 --> 21:26.830
to tighten security against subversive activities.

21:22.210 --> 21:24.130
Don't worry about it. It's not far.

21:24.130 --> 21:26.830
Besides, they're all waiting for you back at Gary's Yard.

21:27.210 --> 21:29.960
And now, here is an address from General Donner to citizens on-

21:36.500 --> 21:38.040
I told you!

21:40.500 --> 21:42.380
To launch firm counterattacks against the invaders,

21:42.380 --> 21:44.040
To launch firm counterattacks against the invaders,

21:42.380 --> 21:44.040
Honestly, what a joke.

21:44.040 --> 21:47.830
the loyal forces of Aphrodia must unite under a new government!

21:48.380 --> 21:51.960
Help us besiege our stolen capital Io and take it back!

21:52.460 --> 21:55.540
The future of our nation will not be taken from us!

21:53.130 --> 21:54.960
The radio broadcast's much more interesting.

21:54.960 --> 21:57.080
Now this is gonna be a real fight!

21:55.540 --> 21:57.080
Justice is on our side!

21:57.710 --> 21:59.500
Believe in victory

21:58.290 --> 21:59.500
Damn idiots!

21:59.500 --> 21:59.920
and help us in the fight to repel these ruthless invaders!

21:59.920 --> 22:01.130
Stop acting like you know shit

22:01.130 --> 22:02.960
when you're just lounging around!

22:02.960 --> 22:05.000
If you ain't got nothin' to do,

22:05.000 --> 22:06.790
go clean that dirty bunk room downstairs or something,

22:06.790 --> 22:08.130
ya good-for-nothin' punks!

22:25.630 --> 22:27.250
I don't like this one bit...

22:31.670 --> 22:33.670
Hey, old man, I'm going out for a bit.

22:33.670 --> 22:34.920
Lemme change here.

22:49.210 --> 22:51.040
Huh? You're actually cleaning for once?

22:52.040 --> 22:53.790
You're going to the stadium?!

22:53.790 --> 22:55.880
It's not safe with what's going on.

22:56.380 --> 22:59.170
With Route 1 wrecked, it won't be on anyone's radar.

22:59.580 --> 23:00.790
Still!

23:02.130 --> 23:03.330
Open it up!

23:04.380 --> 23:05.920
And don't you come after me!

23:14.000 --> 23:15.880
You can't use them?!

23:15.880 --> 23:17.380
Are you kidding me?!

23:17.380 --> 23:20.130
Do you have any idea what I went through
to get these photos?!

23:20.130 --> 23:22.130
No, listen, that's not the problem.

23:22.130 --> 23:23.790
Then what is it?!

23:23.790 --> 23:26.580
Are you saying we can't report on this war?!

23:27.790 --> 23:29.040
That's ridiculous!

23:29.040 --> 23:32.250
An entire capital has been occupied, for god's sake!

23:32.630 --> 23:36.630
Well, the official stance is that the government
welcomed the occupation.

23:37.670 --> 23:40.250
But so many people died!

23:40.250 --> 23:41.460
Even now-

23:41.460 --> 23:42.670
Listen...

23:43.080 --> 23:47.380
All shuttles to Earth could be
canceled indefinitely within the week.

23:47.380 --> 23:50.080
If you want to go home, better do it soon, hmm?

23:50.080 --> 23:51.750
What are you...

23:57.330 --> 23:59.080
I don't believe it...

24:01.330 --> 24:02.630
It's appalling!

24:02.630 --> 24:04.830
Both the military and the media
are a bunch of cowards!

24:05.040 --> 24:07.830
Apparently, the government big shots
fled the city though.

24:09.000 --> 24:13.000
They're gonna regroup somewhere down south
'round Bergama and retake Io.

24:13.000 --> 24:14.830
Like that's ever gonna happen!

24:17.250 --> 24:18.630
Sure, whatever...

24:19.460 --> 24:22.420
But I wouldn't cross your legs like that if I were you.

24:34.630 --> 24:36.290
Damn you!

24:45.670 --> 24:47.750
The situation is inexcusable!

24:48.130 --> 24:51.710
Three days have passed since you agreed
to surrender to our forces,

24:51.710 --> 24:55.710
but there has been an atrocious amount of
organized resistance and acts of terror!

24:55.710 --> 24:58.460
I am the victor here!

24:59.130 --> 25:01.670
And there's a limit to my patience.

25:02.540 --> 25:04.290
If any among you are waiting

25:04.290 --> 25:08.710
for a counterattack by the provisional government
in Bergama and its exiled forces,

25:08.710 --> 25:10.290
I pity your foolishness.

25:12.040 --> 25:18.000
The great war to unite Venus shall end
with Ishtar's victory!

25:18.830 --> 25:22.460
Our tank units have Io City surrounded on all sides.

25:22.710 --> 25:28.630
Defy us, and we can have 200 mm shells
rain down anywhere in the city.

25:29.540 --> 25:32.790
Downtown Io is like a fortress.

25:32.790 --> 25:35.880
But I will not let it become a base of resistance!

25:36.540 --> 25:38.960
You must keep your citizens in check.

25:38.960 --> 25:42.420
Fail, and I shall dissolve your government
and police force immediately,

25:42.420 --> 25:44.210
and send you all...

25:44.830 --> 25:47.040
to Ishtar as prisoners of war!

25:50.630 --> 25:52.880
A curfew is now in effect.

25:53.170 --> 25:57.250
For the next ten hours, citizens must stay in their homes
unless permission is otherwise granted.

25:58.000 --> 25:59.210
I repeat:

26:00.130 --> 26:02.250
A curfew is now in effect.

26:02.880 --> 26:07.210
For the next ten hours, citizens must stay in their homes
unless permission is otherwise granted.

26:29.330 --> 26:30.540
Who is it?

26:30.960 --> 26:32.500
I have something for you.

26:32.500 --> 26:33.960
I'll take whatever you can pay.

26:34.210 --> 26:35.790
Where did you hear about me?

26:35.790 --> 26:37.630
Joe from the Fifth Regiment.

26:38.330 --> 26:39.540
All right.

26:40.630 --> 26:41.830
What's that?

26:43.250 --> 26:44.960
I have kids sleeping in here.

26:44.960 --> 26:46.210
Go 'round back.

26:52.330 --> 26:55.330
Attention all citizens:

26:55.920 --> 26:58.130
In an hour from now, the curfew will take effect.

26:58.130 --> 26:59.330
Shut up!

26:59.330 --> 27:00.420
In an hour from now, the curfew will take effect.

27:11.830 --> 27:14.540
No! I hate this war!

27:15.540 --> 27:17.210
I just hate it!

27:17.880 --> 27:19.330
In an hour from now, the curfew will take effect.

27:19.330 --> 27:20.960
I said, shut up!

27:20.960 --> 27:22.630
In an hour from now, the curfew will take effect.

27:24.000 --> 27:26.420
Yo, Hiro!

27:27.420 --> 27:28.630
Jack?

27:30.830 --> 27:34.250
I never knew you lived all the way up here.

27:34.250 --> 27:39.210
It's not my place, but some relatives
cleared outta the city, so I moved in.

27:39.330 --> 27:41.540
Huh, sounds sweet.

27:41.540 --> 27:42.830
Not at all!

27:42.830 --> 27:46.670
The elevator's broken, and man, it's a hell of a climb!

27:47.580 --> 27:48.710
Hi!

27:48.710 --> 27:50.170
Cathy!

27:51.960 --> 27:53.790
I thought you had a thing with Will?

27:55.210 --> 27:56.790
You know Sue, right?

27:56.790 --> 27:59.250
The one from Earth with the big hair?

27:59.750 --> 28:02.710
Well, he's all over her these days!

28:05.170 --> 28:08.000
So I'm done with that prick!

28:08.000 --> 28:09.210
That's right!

28:13.130 --> 28:15.540
What do you think?
Isn't the view great?

28:16.670 --> 28:18.670
We even have a shower!

28:18.670 --> 28:20.500
Go ahead and use it.
Help yourself.

28:26.210 --> 28:28.130
Hey, Hiro,

28:28.420 --> 28:31.750
I didn't expect to see you around this part of town.

28:32.290 --> 28:35.500
Bet you were gonna meet Maggie for a date, am I right?

28:35.830 --> 28:37.420
Bring her over sometime!

28:37.420 --> 28:38.920
I'm sure she'd like that!

28:39.380 --> 28:40.920
Totally!

28:41.210 --> 28:45.670
Hey, listen, from now on, why don't we
make this the new team hangout?

28:45.830 --> 28:48.290
Gary's Yard is so filthy, y'know?

28:50.830 --> 28:52.040
Crap!

28:54.040 --> 28:55.250
Probably someone you know, right?

28:55.250 --> 28:58.580
C-c'mon, Hiro, can you just tell them no one's home?

29:01.460 --> 29:02.960
No one's home!

29:05.670 --> 29:07.130
Who are you?

29:08.290 --> 29:10.750
A friend; I'm watching the place.

29:22.500 --> 29:23.710
Get your hands up!

29:23.710 --> 29:25.130
Put them behind your head!

29:29.420 --> 29:31.080
"Housesitting"?!

29:31.080 --> 29:32.330
Is that true?!

29:34.040 --> 29:36.290
Then tell me who owns the place!

29:37.130 --> 29:38.460
Speak up!

29:37.630 --> 29:38.460
No!

29:38.460 --> 29:39.540
Stop!

29:39.540 --> 29:40.960
Please!

29:47.880 --> 29:49.080
Why, you!

29:56.630 --> 29:57.920
Hold it! Hey!

29:58.330 --> 29:59.880
Halt or we'll shoot!

30:05.210 --> 30:07.380
Block R! One of the kids got away!

30:07.380 --> 30:08.380
Intercept him!

30:19.130 --> 30:22.330
The curfew is now in effect.

30:23.080 --> 30:29.540
For the next ten hours, citizens must not leave their homes.

30:31.250 --> 30:34.540
The curfew is now in effect.

30:35.540 --> 30:39.460
For the next ten hours, citizens must not...

30:50.580 --> 30:53.170
Wh-what the hell, man?!

31:24.000 --> 31:25.460
Damn it!

31:34.130 --> 31:35.420
Give it up already!

31:35.420 --> 31:36.460
Ow!

31:42.460 --> 31:43.630
Bastards!

31:47.540 --> 31:48.750
This is Unit 04!

31:48.750 --> 31:51.000
The kid just raced out of the Takos Markets on a bike!

31:51.000 --> 31:52.580
He's about to enter an offshoot on Route 5!

31:52.580 --> 31:53.790
Get a unit there!

31:57.670 --> 31:58.880
Damn it!

32:16.540 --> 32:19.040
Idiots, that was a one-way street!

32:19.040 --> 32:20.630
You cops ought'a know that!

32:27.630 --> 32:28.960
Assholes...

32:28.960 --> 32:31.290
Where were you jerks when we lost the war?!

33:33.710 --> 33:34.920
Hey!

33:35.380 --> 33:36.830
Don't move or I'll shoot!

33:39.290 --> 33:40.290
Stop!

34:06.380 --> 34:07.750
Just look at those flames!

34:07.170 --> 34:09.000
No good.

34:07.750 --> 34:09.000
We can't get any closer!

34:09.380 --> 34:10.580
Hey, go around from up top!

34:10.580 --> 34:11.790
All right!

34:38.500 --> 34:39.920
This is awful!

34:59.500 --> 35:01.040
Sorry, Andrew.

35:01.040 --> 35:02.710
Be a good kitty and forgive me, okay?

35:02.710 --> 35:05.380
It slipped my mind when I went shopping.

35:06.540 --> 35:09.000
We can't go out again for a while.

35:09.630 --> 35:11.920
Okay? You'll just have to make do.

35:20.790 --> 35:22.330
Who is it?

35:24.330 --> 35:25.540
Dad?

35:26.330 --> 35:28.080
Hey, it's me...

35:28.080 --> 35:29.290
Hiro!

35:29.880 --> 35:31.920
Wait, what are you doing here?!

35:46.130 --> 35:47.330
Don't touch me!

35:49.210 --> 35:51.540
Sorry, it just really hurts.

35:55.130 --> 35:57.540
Hey, will you let me sleep?

35:58.080 --> 35:59.330
Right here?

35:59.330 --> 36:01.210
Just for a little bit...

36:19.880 --> 36:21.290
Are you awake?

36:26.630 --> 36:30.880
Well, I'm glad I learned how to give
emergency treatment at school!

36:31.540 --> 36:34.250
I'm really getting the hang of it, aren't I?

36:34.250 --> 36:37.290
I've never missed any of my advanced nursing classes!

36:37.830 --> 36:39.750
I'm the only one in the class who hasn't.

36:39.750 --> 36:40.830
Just me.

36:41.710 --> 36:43.210
They all made fun of me for it.

36:43.210 --> 36:47.170
Nobody really believed a war
was going to happen, so...

36:49.040 --> 36:51.130
Uh, can I have my pants?

36:52.500 --> 36:55.830
No! You're not ready to get up just yet!

36:55.830 --> 36:57.080
Come on!

36:57.670 --> 36:58.880
Ow...

36:59.130 --> 37:00.420
Drink up.

37:00.420 --> 37:01.750
It's full of good stuff!

37:01.750 --> 37:03.170
It will make you feel great!

37:03.380 --> 37:04.960
Is it yummy? Hmm?

37:08.420 --> 37:10.880
You'll want some sandwiches, right?!
I'll make some right away!

37:11.210 --> 37:12.540
Hey, hold on!

37:12.710 --> 37:13.960
I should go.

37:13.960 --> 37:15.290
I mean, you're folks must be...

37:15.290 --> 37:16.540
It's fine!

37:17.250 --> 37:23.000
Mom and my little brother already evacuated,
and Dad's busy at the Development Bureau.

37:23.380 --> 37:25.790
Besides, there's a curfew on.

37:25.920 --> 37:27.750
Hold on, it won't take long!

37:30.040 --> 37:32.080
No begging, Andrew!

37:35.960 --> 37:37.380
But that gun wound...

37:37.380 --> 37:39.540
What did you get yourself into?!

37:39.920 --> 37:41.710
You should be more careful!

37:54.580 --> 37:57.960
Hey, we have seafood or egg or prosciutto, but-

37:58.790 --> 38:00.750
What are you doing?
You've got to sit down and-

38:00.750 --> 38:02.080
This photo...

38:04.540 --> 38:05.710
Oh, that?

38:05.710 --> 38:08.130
It's something my dad worked on before.

38:08.670 --> 38:11.420
He got an award because it was so exemplary.

38:11.420 --> 38:13.380
It's my parents' farm.

38:14.630 --> 38:15.880
New Musashi, right?

38:15.880 --> 38:17.250
I'm sure of it.

38:17.250 --> 38:18.670
Wow, really?

38:18.670 --> 38:21.460
That's such a crazy coincidence!

38:23.750 --> 38:25.920
Hey! What was that for?!

38:26.750 --> 38:27.960
It's garbage.

38:28.130 --> 38:29.790
Hiro! There you go again!

38:29.790 --> 38:31.250
But it is!

38:31.920 --> 38:34.330
Garbage is just garbage!

38:35.790 --> 38:37.580
The algae that's grown on the farm...

38:37.920 --> 38:39.420
It's completely useless!

38:39.880 --> 38:43.380
It wilts during the Month of Heat,
the cold kills it during the Month of Darkness,

38:43.380 --> 38:45.420
and you start from scratch the next year!

38:45.880 --> 38:48.580
Bureaucrats don't give a damn
as long as the project goes on!

38:48.880 --> 38:51.830
And the farm owners don't care
as long as they make money!

38:52.460 --> 38:56.580
They talk about how Venus will be lush and
green one day, but it's all a big lie!

38:59.540 --> 39:00.920
Same with this war.

39:01.380 --> 39:04.080
There are no real reasons, no real enemies or allies!

39:04.080 --> 39:05.290
This wound?!

39:06.000 --> 39:08.750
An Aphrodian soldier did this to me!

39:16.130 --> 39:17.330
Stop!

39:17.710 --> 39:20.170
I don't want to hear any more!

39:33.500 --> 39:34.710
Sorry...

39:51.960 --> 39:53.170
Don't...

39:53.830 --> 39:57.000
Who else have you kissed like this?

39:57.830 --> 39:59.920
Miranda? Cathy?

40:01.330 --> 40:03.460
No one, it's my first time.

40:14.630 --> 40:16.130
Where am I going?

40:16.130 --> 40:18.000
This is my house!

40:18.670 --> 40:20.040
I'm with the Development Bureau.

40:20.040 --> 40:21.880
It's a bit of an emergency.
I hope you'll let me through.

40:29.630 --> 40:31.920
Maggie, it's Daddy. Open up!

40:32.750 --> 40:33.960
Over here! Hurry!

40:33.960 --> 40:36.540
Maggie, what's going on?
I know you're in there.

40:38.290 --> 40:39.500
Pants! My pants!

40:39.500 --> 40:40.880
Just get in there!

40:48.750 --> 40:51.210
What happened? What took you so long?

40:51.210 --> 40:53.920
I'm exhausted.
I don't need any messing around.

40:54.380 --> 40:55.630
Is someone here?

40:56.500 --> 40:57.710
No, no!

40:59.380 --> 41:01.080
Hey, the kettle...

41:04.460 --> 41:07.080
What, you made me some sandwiches?

41:08.290 --> 41:10.040
Any word from Mirfeld?

41:10.710 --> 41:12.580
Hmm, didn't think so.

41:14.630 --> 41:15.920
These are delicious.

41:16.630 --> 41:17.830
Maggie!

41:18.670 --> 41:21.500
If all goes well, we should be able
to evacuate next week.

41:21.790 --> 41:25.790
It seems Ishtar doesn't plan on
letting any more citizens out of the city,

41:25.790 --> 41:28.460
but my Development Bureau title should come in handy.

41:30.540 --> 41:34.170
But we're not done tidying the place,
and I have my classes!

41:34.170 --> 41:36.040
Forget about tidying up.

41:36.330 --> 41:37.920
Our lives are at stake, here.

41:42.250 --> 41:43.880
It's all over for Io.

41:43.880 --> 41:45.420
The government's given up on it.

41:45.750 --> 41:47.040
There's nothing to be done.

41:47.040 --> 41:49.080
But I don't want to!

41:49.080 --> 41:50.210
I like Io!

41:50.210 --> 41:52.920
I don't want to leave my friends behind, and-

41:52.920 --> 41:54.130
Maggie!

41:54.920 --> 41:57.790
Don't you understand how hard
I'm working to keep us safe?!

41:58.210 --> 41:59.790
And what friends are you talking about?

41:59.790 --> 42:01.670
You mean those delinquents, right?

42:02.000 --> 42:04.500
Those good-for-nothing racers!

42:04.790 --> 42:06.170
You stay away from them!

42:06.750 --> 42:10.710
All they do is fool around,
with no concern for the real world.

42:10.710 --> 42:13.540
They're worthless trash, all of them!

42:13.540 --> 42:14.880
How could you?!

42:14.880 --> 42:16.290
What do you know?!

42:20.330 --> 42:21.540
What was that?

42:34.790 --> 42:36.040
Hiro...

42:51.080 --> 42:52.290
Idiot!

42:52.540 --> 42:54.790
One look, and of course they were gonna find out!

42:54.790 --> 42:57.830
You obviously don't know anyone
up in the Sky Blue Market!

42:57.830 --> 42:58.880
So?!

42:58.880 --> 43:00.710
What happened to Cathy?

43:00.710 --> 43:06.670
Well, I couldn't protect her from those cops,
so she said she hates me 'cuz I'm such a wimp.

43:08.420 --> 43:09.540
Well, then...

43:09.540 --> 43:11.830
I sure hope Hiro's all right.

43:13.250 --> 43:15.540
He's pretty hotheaded, too.

43:33.210 --> 43:35.420
Wh-wh-what?!
I didn't do anything!

43:51.460 --> 43:53.500
That's an anti-tank missile!

43:54.040 --> 43:55.670
That crafty old geezer...

43:56.330 --> 43:59.540
Who would have thought you guys
would be sleeping on all this?!

44:02.710 --> 44:04.250
This is awesome!

44:04.330 --> 44:06.210
This is the real deal, yo!

44:09.130 --> 44:10.330
Git your hands off those!

44:10.960 --> 44:12.540
What a bunch of naughty kids.

44:12.540 --> 44:15.580
Just pretend you saw nothin', and put 'em back.

44:17.750 --> 44:20.130
Who's the naughty one here?

44:20.540 --> 44:24.460
You've been using the junkyard as a front
for selling stolen military arms.

44:27.080 --> 44:29.250
Are you gonna put 'em back, or not?

44:29.630 --> 44:31.250
I'm just gonna borrow them.

44:31.250 --> 44:34.290
I'll make sure to put them back when I'm done.

44:34.830 --> 44:36.130
Done with what?

44:36.580 --> 44:38.710
Oh, nothing much.

44:39.540 --> 44:43.080
You know that Ishtar tank sitting in our stadium?

44:44.210 --> 44:45.790
I wanna blow it to bits!

44:46.960 --> 44:48.250
F-for real?!

44:48.580 --> 44:49.830
Sounds awesome!

44:49.830 --> 44:50.830
Let's do it!

44:50.830 --> 44:52.040
You bunch of idiots!

44:52.630 --> 44:55.250
You can't bust a tank with those measly things!

44:55.500 --> 44:59.670
The Killer Commandoes aren't like those
sissies in the military, y'know.

44:59.670 --> 45:00.710
That's right!

45:00.710 --> 45:03.500
We'll move in quick, and hit 'em where it hurts!

45:05.330 --> 45:08.380
One round of bullets and you'll all be goners.

45:08.380 --> 45:11.250
You're a bunch of losers who can't even
win a battlebike game!

45:11.250 --> 45:12.920
You'd better think before you talk!

45:12.920 --> 45:14.130
Hey!

45:15.210 --> 45:17.250
You talk like you know it all,

45:17.540 --> 45:20.920
but when did you ever fight against a tank, huh?

45:23.670 --> 45:24.880
Take a look.

45:29.920 --> 45:31.630
It's an old story.

45:32.170 --> 45:33.960
I lost it on Earth...

45:34.170 --> 45:39.540
along with buddies I'll never see again,
all for one miserable tank.

45:42.330 --> 45:46.670
So don't get any stupid ideas about
picking a fight with the military.

45:47.460 --> 45:49.630
Just eat some grub and get to sleep!

45:49.630 --> 45:50.830
Not so fast.

45:53.540 --> 45:54.750
Hiro!

45:55.290 --> 45:56.420
So tell me...

45:57.040 --> 46:01.290
why did you take on that tank back then?

46:04.790 --> 46:06.420
I was a stupid kid.

46:06.790 --> 46:08.000
"Was"?

46:09.210 --> 46:10.420
And?

46:10.960 --> 46:13.790
I was pissed with the authority and their lies.

46:16.380 --> 46:21.290
And so you lost that spirit
along with your right leg, huh?

46:28.630 --> 46:29.670
Hiro...

46:32.880 --> 46:36.380
Jack, how're you gonna fight when
you're scared of a little thunder?!

46:36.380 --> 46:39.380
B-but it just scares me, okay?

46:42.830 --> 46:46.080
Hey, won't Gary be cross
if we use his trailer without asking?

46:46.080 --> 46:47.460
Nah, it's fine.

46:47.790 --> 46:49.130
He's just an old fart.

46:49.130 --> 46:51.580
If he complains, I'll give him a piece of my-

47:01.000 --> 47:03.170
No, this isn't...

47:03.500 --> 47:05.960
Jeez! I'm such a bad boy!

47:05.960 --> 47:08.040
Stop messing around and hurry it up!

47:09.920 --> 47:11.500
Heavy rain's headed this way!

47:11.500 --> 47:14.540
I know you kids have the energy,
so git your hands moving!

47:31.420 --> 47:32.960
Let's go, Chief!

47:50.540 --> 47:52.580
This is just what I need!

47:52.580 --> 47:56.000
"On the Eve of Destruction,
Young Venusians Challenge Colossal Tank!"

47:56.000 --> 47:57.830
What a headline!

47:58.170 --> 47:59.630
Save it, will you?

48:00.790 --> 48:02.330
This isn't for your entertainment.

48:02.330 --> 48:04.380
Though you couldn't care less.

48:04.380 --> 48:06.790
That's totally uncalled for!

48:07.380 --> 48:09.330
Why d'ya have to be so nasty, huh?

48:09.630 --> 48:10.830
Lucky you.

48:10.920 --> 48:13.130
You can just run on home to Earth
and say you saw some shit.

48:13.130 --> 48:14.630
C-cut it out...

48:14.630 --> 48:17.210
Yeah? And so what, huh?!

48:17.210 --> 48:18.250
Come on guys...

48:18.250 --> 48:19.460
Shut the hell up!

48:20.210 --> 48:23.250
This place is too cramped for all your squabbling!

48:23.500 --> 48:24.710
Jeez!

48:24.710 --> 48:26.580
Plus it stinks in here!

48:26.960 --> 48:29.920
You reckon the old man ever cleans the inside?

48:29.920 --> 48:31.670
Of course not, dimwit.

48:31.670 --> 48:33.080
It reeks of oil!

48:43.920 --> 48:45.170
That's it, eh?

48:49.830 --> 48:52.130
Guards on the lookout, of course.

49:01.710 --> 49:03.420
Time to go! Come on, guys!

49:05.580 --> 49:07.500
Rob, you'd better back me up!

49:16.420 --> 49:18.420
Hurry it up! Come on!

49:23.460 --> 49:25.210
Wanna get deep-fried, idiot?!

49:27.880 --> 49:29.380
Hurry up, will you?!

49:29.380 --> 49:31.000
They've left already!

49:31.000 --> 49:32.210
Hold your horses.

49:33.710 --> 49:35.420
You're really tagging along?

49:35.880 --> 49:37.080
Jeez...

49:38.420 --> 49:40.500
I'm going into battle with a girl!

49:54.710 --> 49:56.710
Got the first shot!

50:10.210 --> 50:11.420
What the?!

50:11.420 --> 50:13.040
Maybe no one's onboard?

50:16.920 --> 50:18.130
Look out!

50:21.630 --> 50:22.830
Stay away!

50:23.080 --> 50:25.080
Stay away! Stay away! Stay away!

50:25.080 --> 50:26.290
Stay away!

50:29.540 --> 50:30.920
Damn idiot...

50:32.540 --> 50:35.000
H-hold it! Time out!

50:35.000 --> 50:36.210
I can't deal with this!

50:36.210 --> 50:37.380
We're done?

50:37.380 --> 50:39.630
You're way more dangerous than the enemy!

51:00.630 --> 51:01.880
Don't get thrown off!

51:12.670 --> 51:14.630
This isn't what we planned!

51:24.380 --> 51:25.670
Kenny! Tao!

51:25.880 --> 51:27.290
Get off the track!

51:32.630 --> 51:34.040
Do you hear me, Will?!

51:34.540 --> 51:36.080
You can't let that thing turn back!

51:36.670 --> 51:39.500
Lure the tank out to the far end of the stretch!

51:39.790 --> 51:42.750
Leave it to the tin migratory bird and his little sparrow!

51:43.210 --> 51:44.670
Who's your "little sparrow"?

51:48.250 --> 51:49.500
Toodles!

51:58.500 --> 52:01.960
It's like, we came here to destroy the stadium.

52:06.830 --> 52:08.500
We're counting on you, old man!

52:09.170 --> 52:10.420
It's our turn!

52:10.670 --> 52:13.880
The adrenaline rush duo here, ready for action!

52:13.880 --> 52:15.290
Look who's talking!

52:21.920 --> 52:24.710
Here's one extra-large Molotov cocktail...

52:25.000 --> 52:26.380
coming right up!

52:38.630 --> 52:39.830
Yes!

52:44.750 --> 52:46.040
We did it!

52:52.880 --> 52:55.380
Premium fuel burns real nice.

53:08.960 --> 53:10.380
You're kidding me, right?

53:10.380 --> 53:12.000
This ain't good. Run!

53:32.790 --> 53:33.880
Jack!

53:34.380 --> 53:36.080
No! Get down, Jack!

53:39.830 --> 53:41.040
Jack!

54:28.540 --> 54:29.830
Move...

54:29.830 --> 54:31.130
Please move!

54:55.710 --> 54:57.670
Go!

55:26.380 --> 55:27.580
Hiro?

55:27.830 --> 55:29.040
Isn't that Hiro?!

55:29.040 --> 55:30.250
Hiro?!

55:30.460 --> 55:32.250
That idiot!

55:34.210 --> 55:35.210
Rob!

55:51.290 --> 55:52.710
Stop!

55:52.710 --> 55:54.500
That's enough!

56:00.130 --> 56:03.130
Fool! There's no need to take things this far!

56:08.670 --> 56:10.500
Get outta there!

56:11.000 --> 56:12.540
You'll get yourself killed!

56:12.540 --> 56:15.750
It's fine! Y'all did everything you could!

56:15.750 --> 56:17.790
Don't be stupid!

56:18.130 --> 56:21.330
There are good things waiting in life,
so long as you're alive!

56:28.420 --> 56:29.670
Are you taping this?

56:30.500 --> 56:31.580
Tape it.

56:31.580 --> 56:32.580
But...

56:32.580 --> 56:33.580
You're a pro, right?

56:33.580 --> 56:34.790
They deserve it.

57:23.170 --> 57:25.420
Damn it! Another one!

57:25.420 --> 57:26.960
Clear out! Get to the south gate!

57:26.960 --> 57:28.170
Quick!

57:31.750 --> 57:33.830
Miranda, hop on!

57:40.790 --> 57:43.250
The south gate's no good.
It's blocked!

57:43.250 --> 57:44.960
Crap, they've got us figured!

57:51.000 --> 57:52.170
What are those?

58:48.080 --> 58:51.040
Didn't expect battlebike riders to beat us here.

59:08.290 --> 59:09.500
What's the matter?!

59:09.500 --> 59:11.210
Can't even draw out half its power?

59:12.000 --> 59:13.750
Your machine's so bored it's yawning!

59:14.790 --> 59:16.250
Step on that gas!

59:16.460 --> 59:17.880
You call yourself battlebike riders?!

59:22.460 --> 59:24.130
27, take pit number three!

59:25.960 --> 59:27.250
34, wait!

59:27.920 --> 59:29.130
Standby outside.

59:32.920 --> 59:34.460
We're at war either way, right?

59:34.460 --> 59:36.540
It's not like it's any safer back in town.

59:37.170 --> 59:40.790
And being able to ride those things
is pretty sweet, right?

59:45.380 --> 59:47.670
Hey, wanna take a shower?
It feels great!

59:49.130 --> 59:50.330
Jackass!

59:51.040 --> 59:52.130
Listen up!

59:52.130 --> 59:56.380
The FMB isn't like the kiddy machines you're used to!

59:56.880 --> 59:59.210
It's a bike, but it has the horsepower of a jeep!

01:00:00.290 --> 01:00:03.330
And the power of the new railgun has
proven to be very effective.

01:00:04.080 --> 01:00:05.670
Even up against an Octopus,

01:00:06.460 --> 01:00:09.580
as long as you have one of these,
you've got nothing to fear!

01:00:10.380 --> 01:00:12.420
Hey, what is all this, man?

01:00:10.380 --> 01:00:13.670
It can pierce several feet of armor
and wreck a tank in one blow!

01:00:12.420 --> 01:00:13.670
I'm dying here...

01:00:13.670 --> 01:00:15.130
My leg might be busted.

01:00:15.540 --> 01:00:17.290
You there, no talking.

01:00:18.920 --> 01:00:22.330
Of course, that's only if you ride them right.

01:00:23.080 --> 01:00:24.630
Better train your asses off!

01:00:25.040 --> 01:00:27.170
If you don't want to die, that is.

01:00:28.290 --> 01:00:29.750
What the hell?!

01:00:30.330 --> 01:00:31.920
No way I'm takin' orders from him!

01:00:31.920 --> 01:00:35.170
But they saved us at the stadium, y'know?

01:00:35.170 --> 01:00:36.380
Dipshit!

01:00:36.670 --> 01:00:38.920
We never asked them to save us!

01:00:39.330 --> 01:00:40.670
Stop pushing me!

01:00:40.670 --> 01:00:42.080
Hey, you perv!

01:00:43.540 --> 01:00:46.250
Jeez! You guys are so rough!

01:00:46.250 --> 01:00:47.500
Yo!

01:00:47.750 --> 01:00:49.540
Hey, how's it going?!

01:00:58.210 --> 01:00:59.540
We're moving again?

01:00:59.540 --> 01:01:01.040
For the third time!

01:01:02.460 --> 01:01:03.960
We're heading west.

01:01:04.290 --> 01:01:05.290
You can tell?!

01:01:05.290 --> 01:01:06.290
Just a hunch.

01:01:06.290 --> 01:01:07.290
That means...

01:01:08.380 --> 01:01:10.790
That's out towards the Donlets Desert.

01:01:11.580 --> 01:01:13.170
We'll really be far from Io then.

01:01:14.250 --> 01:01:16.250
So what happened with you?

01:01:16.540 --> 01:01:18.290
I'm being sent back to Io.

01:01:18.670 --> 01:01:19.880
Lucky you!

01:01:19.880 --> 01:01:23.290
At least that's what was supposed to happen,
but apparently I won't be.

01:01:23.580 --> 01:01:26.130
'Cuz I might leak info on this raid unit.

01:01:27.210 --> 01:01:28.830
Same goes for us, then?

01:01:30.540 --> 01:01:34.420
Whose stupid idea was it to attack that tank, anyway?!

01:01:34.420 --> 01:01:35.920
Oh, I'm sorry.

01:01:35.920 --> 01:01:37.130
That was me.

01:01:37.920 --> 01:01:39.330
Keep it down, will you?!

01:01:40.290 --> 01:01:42.880
We only ever get to rest when we're on the move!

01:01:42.880 --> 01:01:44.500
So shut up and hit the sack, kids!

01:01:46.630 --> 01:01:47.790
Where's Hiro?

01:01:47.790 --> 01:01:49.500
I saw him go below earlier.

01:01:49.920 --> 01:01:52.080
You think he's scared, too?

01:01:52.080 --> 01:01:53.290
Beats me.

01:02:00.210 --> 01:02:03.040
You wanna start a battlebike team?

01:02:05.210 --> 01:02:06.500
Fine by me.

01:02:06.500 --> 01:02:08.000
What do I care?

01:02:09.080 --> 01:02:11.750
All you kids ever do is loaf around.

01:02:11.750 --> 01:02:13.630
Freeloading ne'er-do wells!

01:02:14.420 --> 01:02:15.830
You lost again?

01:02:15.830 --> 01:02:17.380
Tough beans!

01:02:18.500 --> 01:02:20.670
Why don't you help out for a change?!

01:02:31.290 --> 01:02:32.500
Who's there?

01:02:35.790 --> 01:02:37.580
Oh, it's you, kid.

01:02:39.630 --> 01:02:41.080
What were you up to?

01:02:42.880 --> 01:02:44.500
You like 'em?

01:02:44.500 --> 01:02:47.330
When you know which one's yours, lemme know.

01:02:47.330 --> 01:02:49.670
I'll tune it just the way you want.

01:02:50.000 --> 01:02:52.540
Honestly, those things are pretty impressive.

01:02:54.750 --> 01:02:58.750
Considerin' they'll be coffins for you crazy daredevils.

01:03:04.460 --> 01:03:07.250
Hey, do you really have to go?!

01:03:07.250 --> 01:03:09.710
What?! Can't hear you!

01:03:12.130 --> 01:03:13.750
I'll bring you back something good!

01:03:16.630 --> 01:03:19.830
Hey you, you'll wear out the rear like that!

01:03:20.250 --> 01:03:21.250
Look!

01:03:21.250 --> 01:03:22.460
That's him, Number 16!

01:03:22.460 --> 01:03:24.170
They're gonna take out a supply truck.

01:03:24.170 --> 01:03:25.420
That's nuts!

01:03:25.880 --> 01:03:27.880
He's hardly gotten any training!

01:03:29.920 --> 01:03:33.500
Aww, I missed him...

01:04:19.290 --> 01:04:21.080
Man, that was crazy!

01:04:21.080 --> 01:04:24.080
That huge sucker was chock full of ammo!

01:04:24.080 --> 01:04:25.630
And we blew it all up,

01:04:25.630 --> 01:04:29.130
so those Ishtar shmucks back in Io
are in tears about now, I bet!

01:04:29.500 --> 01:04:32.330
Wow, you're like a real soldier!

01:04:32.330 --> 01:04:34.630
Cool stuff, combat rider!

01:04:34.630 --> 01:04:35.830
Y'think?

01:04:36.330 --> 01:04:38.290
Then how 'bout we do dinner later?

01:04:38.290 --> 01:04:39.500
My treat!

01:04:39.500 --> 01:04:42.540
What about Cafe Bouget on St. Germain Street?

01:04:42.830 --> 01:04:44.080
Sounds great!

01:04:44.960 --> 01:04:46.670
Yo, head scorer!

01:04:46.960 --> 01:04:48.790
Aren't you bored?

01:04:48.790 --> 01:04:50.710
The battlefield's hot, yo!

01:04:50.710 --> 01:04:52.830
Battlebike games don't even compare!

01:04:52.920 --> 01:04:54.000
You should come, Hiro!

01:04:54.000 --> 01:04:56.500
I'll save you some of the action, I swear.

01:04:58.210 --> 01:04:59.500
No way.

01:05:00.790 --> 01:05:02.460
You really enjoy it, huh?

01:05:02.830 --> 01:05:04.630
Being the military's bitch?

01:05:06.630 --> 01:05:08.130
What the hell, man?

01:05:09.000 --> 01:05:11.460
I just risked my life taking out the enemy.

01:05:11.920 --> 01:05:13.130
You gotta problem with that?

01:05:13.540 --> 01:05:17.460
Don't you know some of Io's Security Force
have sided with Ishtar?

01:05:17.460 --> 01:05:20.420
Hey, we're not like those fucking cowards, you know!

01:05:20.420 --> 01:05:21.630
Hold it!

01:05:22.250 --> 01:05:24.000
You're the coward, Hiro!

01:05:24.290 --> 01:05:30.330
You talk like your smart, but you're just scared
to go into battle like Will does!

01:05:30.330 --> 01:05:31.330
You're wrong!

01:05:31.330 --> 01:05:32.540
No, I'm not!

01:05:32.540 --> 01:05:36.790
Jeez, you get shot by a soldier once
and now you're sulking like a little wimp!

01:05:36.790 --> 01:05:38.420
And you call yourself a man-

01:05:42.210 --> 01:05:43.460
What was that for?!

01:05:43.920 --> 01:05:45.500
This is none of your business.

01:05:45.790 --> 01:05:49.670
Since when do you decide whether
Hiro's a man or not?

01:05:50.460 --> 01:05:52.540
What do you know about anything?

01:05:52.830 --> 01:05:55.170
You only got here a few days ago!

01:05:58.170 --> 01:05:59.380
Wait, hold up!

01:05:59.380 --> 01:06:00.580
C'mon, hang on!

01:06:00.580 --> 01:06:01.580
Sue! Sue!

01:06:01.580 --> 01:06:02.830
Sue, c'mon...

01:06:07.080 --> 01:06:08.380
Attention!

01:06:17.500 --> 01:06:21.250
It's good to see that things are going well,
Colonel Simms.

01:06:21.250 --> 01:06:22.420
Yes, sir!

01:06:22.880 --> 01:06:26.130
Cutting off their supply route is a great achievement.

01:06:26.130 --> 01:06:29.000
That Donner must be starting to panic.

01:06:29.420 --> 01:06:32.460
Reckless provocation comes with a hefty price.

01:06:32.750 --> 01:06:36.630
It's time for the central government in Ishtar
to learn their lesson.

01:06:36.960 --> 01:06:39.330
A-ah, of course...

01:06:39.500 --> 01:06:43.170
Using monobikes was a brilliant idea.

01:06:43.500 --> 01:06:46.580
Should they prove effective as tank busters,

01:06:46.580 --> 01:06:50.210
they may be a major factor in
turning the tide of the war.

01:06:50.210 --> 01:06:51.250
Exactly, sir!

01:06:51.250 --> 01:06:54.080
Plus they don't cost us much,
and we have no shortage of riders!

01:06:54.080 --> 01:06:58.540
Just the other day, one of the delinquent bikers
we picked up during our mission in the city

01:06:58.540 --> 01:07:00.130
did a worthy job on an attack-

01:07:00.130 --> 01:07:02.000
I'd hardly call it "worthy."

01:07:02.000 --> 01:07:03.000
Captain Carts!

01:07:03.000 --> 01:07:04.380
But it's true that he-

01:07:04.380 --> 01:07:06.630
It comes down to a matter of quality, obviously.

01:07:06.830 --> 01:07:08.920
That may be true, but you don't have to-

01:07:08.920 --> 01:07:10.130
Enough.

01:07:10.920 --> 01:07:12.830
Just do your best.

01:07:12.830 --> 01:07:15.420
The countdown to retaking the capital has begun.

01:07:15.420 --> 01:07:20.670
Bergama HQ has high hopes for what
your mobile forces will accomplish.

01:07:20.670 --> 01:07:22.830
A report from special intelligence!

01:07:23.080 --> 01:07:26.130
The major enemy supply convoy
that landed near Dardanus...

01:07:26.130 --> 01:07:29.790
The major enemy supply convoy
that landed near Dardanus...

01:07:30.040 --> 01:07:33.630
is currently 100 km northwest of here!

01:07:34.380 --> 01:07:36.670
It's a huge convoy that's well protected.

01:07:37.130 --> 01:07:40.040
They're going to be tough, so get yourselves ready!

01:07:41.210 --> 01:07:42.460
No friggin' way!

01:07:42.460 --> 01:07:43.460
Why not?!

01:07:43.460 --> 01:07:45.500
Why can't I go with you?!

01:07:46.210 --> 01:07:48.920
'Cuz well, this is a war! A real one!

01:07:49.460 --> 01:07:50.880
You can't just-

01:07:49.880 --> 01:07:50.880
Can't what?!

01:07:50.880 --> 01:07:53.250
You think I'm just a stupid broad, too?!

01:07:54.210 --> 01:07:56.000
No, no! That's not it!

01:07:56.000 --> 01:07:57.540
It's just, it's too dangerous is-

01:07:57.540 --> 01:07:59.460
You do think I'm stupid!

01:07:59.460 --> 01:08:03.630
Sure, I'm an outsider and just a rookie journalist, but...

01:08:03.630 --> 01:08:05.130
but that doesn't mean...

01:08:12.540 --> 01:08:14.580
You want to attach the camera here?

01:08:14.580 --> 01:08:16.250
Yup! And run the shutter up inside.

01:08:16.250 --> 01:08:17.750
You're so smart!

01:08:17.750 --> 01:08:18.750
Y'think?

01:08:18.750 --> 01:08:21.040
Should we really be doing this?

01:08:23.000 --> 01:08:24.250
Good!

01:08:24.960 --> 01:08:26.790
Don't tell the Chief, 'kay?

01:08:27.290 --> 01:08:28.960
I bet he'll find out, though.

01:08:28.960 --> 01:08:31.080
Will, good luck!

01:08:31.080 --> 01:08:33.210
Make sure you get it all on tape!

01:08:44.670 --> 01:08:48.080
HQ to Omega Insurgent, over.

01:08:48.460 --> 01:08:51.460
Omega Insurgent here, I read you.

01:08:52.040 --> 01:08:54.210
HQ to Omega Insurgent:

01:08:54.210 --> 01:08:56.750
The broilers have entered the slaughterhouse.

01:08:57.000 --> 01:08:58.000
I repeat:

01:08:58.000 --> 01:09:00.420
The broilers have entered the slaughterhouse.

01:09:00.630 --> 01:09:01.460
Roger that.

01:09:01.580 --> 01:09:04.380
Ikiteru sono wake o

01:09:01.580 --> 01:09:04.380
I'm not just trying to figure out

01:09:03.170 --> 01:09:05.290
All Hound units, prepare for battle!

01:09:05.290 --> 01:09:08.880
Tashikameteru dake janai sa

01:09:05.290 --> 01:09:08.880
What I'm living for

01:09:09.580 --> 01:09:14.960
Kitto yume o masayume ni shite

01:09:09.580 --> 01:09:14.960
I swear I'll make my dream a reality

01:09:10.080 --> 01:09:12.960
Yo, I hear Will set off with a camera on his bike?

01:09:13.580 --> 01:09:14.960
Will you pipe down?

01:09:15.080 --> 01:09:17.170
Don't talk to me! I'm busy right now!

01:09:15.670 --> 01:09:18.710
Oteage sunzen to

01:09:15.670 --> 01:09:18.710
I want to share a firm embrace

01:09:19.080 --> 01:09:23.420
Iwaretsuzuketa nakama tachi to

01:09:19.080 --> 01:09:23.420
With those buddies of mine

01:09:21.460 --> 01:09:22.670
Got it!

01:09:23.790 --> 01:09:28.040
Atsuku dakishimeaitai

01:09:23.790 --> 01:09:28.040
Who society all but gave up on

01:09:25.210 --> 01:09:27.040
Wow, it looks great!

01:09:27.460 --> 01:09:29.290
Current location: "slaughterhouse!"

01:09:28.040 --> 01:09:32.380
You don't know the way I take

01:09:28.040 --> 01:09:32.380
You don't know how I take things

01:09:29.290 --> 01:09:31.130
At the edge of the Dontlets Desert!

01:09:31.130 --> 01:09:32.880
Sue! Hey, Sue!

01:09:32.380 --> 01:09:35.580
So I ride over your ache

01:09:32.380 --> 01:09:35.580
So I ride over your pain

01:09:32.880 --> 01:09:34.170
Are you getting this?

01:09:35.790 --> 01:09:41.710
Kawaitemo heart sa

01:09:35.790 --> 01:09:41.710
A parched heart is still a heart

01:09:36.380 --> 01:09:38.830
The enemy convoy should be just up ahead.

01:09:39.210 --> 01:09:40.920
It's a countdown to the kickoff!

01:09:42.960 --> 01:09:47.000
Sakarau mukaikaze

01:09:42.960 --> 01:09:47.000
The oncoming wind is against me

01:09:47.210 --> 01:09:50.000
Kizu ni kaikan

01:09:47.210 --> 01:09:50.000
It feels good on my wounds

01:09:47.960 --> 01:09:48.960
Yeah!

01:09:48.960 --> 01:09:50.000
Go get 'em!

01:09:50.130 --> 01:09:54.000
Sonokide konai nara

01:09:50.130 --> 01:09:54.000
If you aren't going to come prepared

01:09:50.580 --> 01:09:51.920
Whoa!

01:09:51.920 --> 01:09:53.540
No cutsies, man!

01:09:53.540 --> 01:09:55.250
Left wing, stay in formation!

01:09:54.000 --> 01:09:57.880
Koi nante yuuna yo

01:09:54.000 --> 01:09:57.880
Don't talk to me about love

01:09:55.250 --> 01:09:56.460
2,000 meters to the enemy!

01:09:56.460 --> 01:09:57.880
Guard vehicles up ahead!

01:09:58.670 --> 01:10:02.080
On the Venus

01:09:58.670 --> 01:10:02.080
On Venus

01:10:03.080 --> 01:10:04.330
Incoming!

01:10:05.630 --> 01:10:07.080
It's not an Octopus.

01:10:07.080 --> 01:10:08.170
I got 'im!

01:10:08.960 --> 01:10:10.170
It's huge!

01:10:14.790 --> 01:10:16.290
Damn!

01:10:17.920 --> 01:10:19.630
That's enough! Stop!

01:10:22.170 --> 01:10:23.750
Yeah, take that!

01:10:25.250 --> 01:10:26.880
Gotta nail its head, I guess.

01:10:30.210 --> 01:10:31.790
The head! Get the head!

01:10:31.790 --> 01:10:33.420
One of you guys up ahead?

01:10:33.420 --> 01:10:35.330
What're you all doing?

01:10:35.330 --> 01:10:36.880
You gotta nail the head!

01:10:36.880 --> 01:10:38.250
Jeez, guys!

01:10:39.250 --> 01:10:40.380
What happened?

01:10:40.750 --> 01:10:42.420
That didn't look good...

01:10:44.540 --> 01:10:45.630
That's strange.

01:10:45.630 --> 01:10:46.880
What's wrong with this?!

01:10:51.460 --> 01:10:52.670
Will?

01:10:52.670 --> 01:10:53.880
Hey, Will?

01:10:53.880 --> 01:10:55.290
What's going on?!

01:10:55.290 --> 01:10:56.500
Hey!

01:10:56.500 --> 01:10:57.500
No!

01:10:57.500 --> 01:10:59.210
Please, come on!

01:10:59.500 --> 01:11:01.330
What happened to you?!

01:11:05.670 --> 01:11:06.920
The machines can wait!

01:11:06.920 --> 01:11:08.920
Get the wounded up first!

01:11:10.460 --> 01:11:12.290
That one's done for! Leave it!

01:11:12.670 --> 01:11:15.000
Hey! Over here, quick!

01:11:15.460 --> 01:11:16.710
Hurry!

01:11:16.710 --> 01:11:18.920
We clear out immediately!

01:11:19.040 --> 01:11:20.330
Medic! I need a medic!

01:11:20.330 --> 01:11:21.880
Don't block the ramp!

01:11:22.170 --> 01:11:24.540
Number 16! Does anyone see 16?!

01:11:25.210 --> 01:11:27.210
Where's Will on Number 16?!

01:11:27.750 --> 01:11:28.750
Will!

01:11:28.750 --> 01:11:30.790
Will! Answer me!

01:11:30.790 --> 01:11:33.880
Looks like we've taken quite a hit, Captain.

01:11:34.330 --> 01:11:37.880
Like I said, it comes down to a matter of quality.

01:11:37.880 --> 01:11:40.210
That, and how much training they've undergone.

01:11:40.540 --> 01:11:45.130
But if they were dispensable to begin with,
then that's that.

01:11:57.040 --> 01:11:58.380
Hey, about Sue...

01:11:58.380 --> 01:11:59.460
She's gone.

01:11:59.460 --> 01:12:01.040
I've looked all over.

01:12:01.290 --> 01:12:02.920
Maybe she's on a different carrier?

01:12:02.920 --> 01:12:04.330
I don't think so.

01:12:05.500 --> 01:12:07.460
What?! You let her take a buggy?!

01:12:07.920 --> 01:12:09.210
Morons!

01:12:09.330 --> 01:12:13.790
B-b-but she insisted on going out to check on her own-

01:12:13.790 --> 01:12:15.290
You saps!

01:12:15.290 --> 01:12:17.540
Did you really think she'd come back?!

01:12:17.750 --> 01:12:19.960
If the Colonel finds out, you're dead meat!

01:12:52.830 --> 01:12:54.580
You want to go back to the city?

01:12:56.040 --> 01:12:58.080
How many times must I tell you?

01:12:59.920 --> 01:13:03.210
Now that you've joined us,

01:13:03.210 --> 01:13:06.330
I can't just let you up and leave.

01:13:07.170 --> 01:13:08.580
Or what?

01:13:10.420 --> 01:13:13.000
I know that journalist ran off,

01:13:13.000 --> 01:13:16.040
but are you scared now that you've
seen your buddy die?

01:13:16.040 --> 01:13:17.250
You're wrong!

01:13:19.210 --> 01:13:20.630
How so?

01:13:22.710 --> 01:13:24.880
You have no right to be spouting this shit.

01:13:25.420 --> 01:13:27.330
You've got nothing to do with us!

01:13:27.750 --> 01:13:29.500
You can't order us around!

01:13:29.750 --> 01:13:31.040
You sure got spunk.

01:13:31.040 --> 01:13:33.460
Very well, no more orders.
Do as you like.

01:13:33.460 --> 01:13:34.670
However...

01:13:34.670 --> 01:13:38.500
set one foot out of the camp
and I'll shoot you dead without warning.

01:13:38.500 --> 01:13:40.500
To keep our operation secret.

01:13:43.330 --> 01:13:44.630
Damn you!

01:13:46.210 --> 01:13:47.960
That's really some spunk you've got!

01:13:48.710 --> 01:13:51.420
Why can't you put it to good use?

01:13:53.380 --> 01:13:56.960
I've tried to get you to train over and over,
but you never shape up.

01:13:57.330 --> 01:13:58.330
Why?!

01:14:02.880 --> 01:14:08.080
Now that our nation and our people are being invaded,
those who refuse to fight are human scum!

01:14:08.080 --> 01:14:10.630
What do you think 16 would say from his grave?!

01:14:12.170 --> 01:14:14.040
Do you still want to go home?

01:14:14.670 --> 01:14:15.920
Then so be it.

01:14:16.460 --> 01:14:17.670
I'll let you go.

01:14:17.670 --> 01:14:21.670
But only after you show me you've
got the guts of a real man.

01:14:23.420 --> 01:14:24.630
Beat me.

01:14:24.880 --> 01:14:26.170
If you do...

01:14:29.750 --> 01:14:30.790
Hiro, don't do this!

01:14:30.790 --> 01:14:32.000
H-hey!

01:14:32.960 --> 01:14:34.170
What's the challenge?

01:14:34.170 --> 01:14:35.630
What else?

01:14:36.460 --> 01:14:37.710
You know what I mean.

01:14:39.630 --> 01:14:40.630
Listen...

01:14:40.630 --> 01:14:43.250
This ravine runs about 5 km to the main canyon.

01:14:43.250 --> 01:14:45.420
Whoever gets through first, wins.

01:14:46.420 --> 01:14:47.750
But be on your guard.

01:14:47.750 --> 01:14:49.460
These things come with weapons.

01:14:51.170 --> 01:14:54.460
Even if you're shot down from behind,
it's all in the game.

01:14:55.580 --> 01:14:56.790
Don't worry.

01:14:56.790 --> 01:14:58.500
The railguns aren't loaded.

01:14:58.790 --> 01:15:02.330
A machine gun shot or two won't kill you, if you're lucky.

01:15:03.040 --> 01:15:04.250
Don't, Hiro!

01:15:04.250 --> 01:15:05.460
This is nuts!

01:15:06.250 --> 01:15:09.000
Go on ahead if you think you can escape my range.

01:15:09.000 --> 01:15:11.130
I'll give you a ten-second head start.

01:15:19.580 --> 01:15:20.920
One!

01:15:20.920 --> 01:15:22.040
Two!

01:15:22.040 --> 01:15:23.170
Three!

01:15:23.170 --> 01:15:24.210
Four!

01:15:24.210 --> 01:15:25.250
Five!

01:15:25.250 --> 01:15:26.250
Six!

01:15:26.250 --> 01:15:27.250
Seven!

01:15:27.250 --> 01:15:28.330
Eight!

01:15:28.330 --> 01:15:29.580
Nine!

01:15:29.580 --> 01:15:30.790
Ten!

01:17:33.000 --> 01:17:35.960
Can't say you won when only your tire made it.

01:17:45.040 --> 01:17:46.290
A deal's a deal.

01:17:49.580 --> 01:17:51.380
You have to stay.

01:17:52.210 --> 01:17:53.420
Understand?

01:17:55.880 --> 01:17:58.670
Sorry we're leaving without you.

01:18:00.330 --> 01:18:02.790
Anything we can do for you back in Io?

01:18:02.790 --> 01:18:05.880
We'll let Maggie know you're doing okay, and-

01:18:05.880 --> 01:18:07.250
Forget it.

01:18:07.250 --> 01:18:09.040
She'll have evacuated already.

01:18:09.880 --> 01:18:11.960
Anyway, you should get going.

01:18:12.670 --> 01:18:15.420
Who knows when that bastard could change his mind?

01:18:15.790 --> 01:18:17.250
Don't die on us, okay?

01:18:19.210 --> 01:18:21.920
Don't let yourself get reckless!

01:18:23.130 --> 01:18:25.330
That's your biggest problem, y'know!

01:18:28.080 --> 01:18:29.380
Come back alive!

01:18:32.290 --> 01:18:35.750
Our team's nothing without you!

01:18:39.960 --> 01:18:44.460
Counteroffensive Underway

01:18:48.420 --> 01:18:51.420
Hear that?! There's gunfire all around Io!

01:18:51.420 --> 01:18:52.830
Get what that means?

01:18:52.830 --> 01:18:54.040
Do you?!

01:18:54.580 --> 01:18:56.420
It's a complete counterattack!

01:18:56.420 --> 01:18:57.630
What did I tell you?!

01:18:59.750 --> 01:19:01.080
Is this Logistics Command HQ?

01:19:01.080 --> 01:19:02.750
Where's our ammunition?

01:19:02.920 --> 01:19:04.630
How much longer do we have to wait?!

01:19:05.080 --> 01:19:06.380
You got intercepted?!

01:19:06.380 --> 01:19:07.830
That's not an excuse!

01:19:07.830 --> 01:19:09.880
Listen, get it here, now!

01:19:09.880 --> 01:19:11.080
With more fuel!

01:19:12.040 --> 01:19:13.040
What is it?

01:19:13.040 --> 01:19:15.750
It's a request for an interview with you, General.

01:19:16.210 --> 01:19:17.420
Turn it down!

01:19:17.420 --> 01:19:18.830
We have more pressing matters!

01:19:19.250 --> 01:19:24.750
Sir! But this woman journalist says she's on
special assignment from Earth.

01:19:26.130 --> 01:19:27.330
Very well.

01:19:27.830 --> 01:19:29.040
Let her in.

01:19:41.920 --> 01:19:44.630
I appreciate your kindness, General.

01:19:45.000 --> 01:19:46.210
Well, well...

01:19:47.000 --> 01:19:50.080
All the way from some fifty million
kilometers off in space.

01:19:50.540 --> 01:19:52.040
Welcome.

01:19:57.790 --> 01:19:59.000
You seem nervous.

01:19:59.000 --> 01:20:00.210
You're trembling.

01:20:02.460 --> 01:20:03.790
No need to worry.

01:20:03.790 --> 01:20:06.130
They'll never get this far.

01:20:12.710 --> 01:20:16.290
Aphrodia's simply a rotten mob of vulgar fools.

01:20:16.290 --> 01:20:18.210
They don't stand a chance against Ishtar.

01:20:18.580 --> 01:20:21.750
My! Confident, aren't we?

01:20:24.920 --> 01:20:29.000
General, do you mind if I snap a portrait
before the interview?

01:20:30.580 --> 01:20:33.670
You want me to smile for my friends on Earth?

01:20:33.670 --> 01:20:37.380
Yes, with real sincerity.

01:20:44.500 --> 01:20:46.080
Stop that! Stop!

01:20:47.080 --> 01:20:48.580
Let 'er rip!

01:21:04.330 --> 01:21:06.000
This is a surprise.

01:21:07.170 --> 01:21:10.380
Does the press on Earth conspire with terrorists?

01:21:10.580 --> 01:21:12.420
I'm not a terrorist!

01:21:12.420 --> 01:21:14.880
I'm a genuine journalist with the press!

01:21:15.170 --> 01:21:16.540
But I've had enough!

01:21:17.460 --> 01:21:19.380
All I want is to shoot you dead, that's all!

01:21:20.000 --> 01:21:21.420
I loved him!

01:21:21.630 --> 01:21:24.630
He was a good guy and you killed him!

01:21:25.790 --> 01:21:28.080
That kind of thing happens all the time.

01:21:28.630 --> 01:21:29.830
I'm not the one to blame.

01:21:29.830 --> 01:21:31.040
You deny it?

01:21:31.250 --> 01:21:32.250
Coward!

01:21:32.250 --> 01:21:33.500
It's not just him.

01:21:33.500 --> 01:21:37.080
You've got so much innocent blood on your hands!

01:21:37.500 --> 01:21:40.210
You're awfully naive for a reporter.

01:21:40.580 --> 01:21:42.750
Commanders don't kill people.

01:21:42.920 --> 01:21:44.210
Neither do soldiers.

01:21:44.750 --> 01:21:47.330
What kills people is war.

01:21:48.500 --> 01:21:50.540
War in the name of justice kills.

01:21:50.540 --> 01:21:52.210
That's why it's merciless.

01:21:52.210 --> 01:21:53.630
And none can be blamed.

01:21:54.130 --> 01:21:55.330
What's wrong?

01:21:55.420 --> 01:21:59.790
Does growing up in Earth's utopian peace
mean you never learned such a self-evident truth?

01:21:59.790 --> 01:22:01.210
Shut up!

01:22:15.670 --> 01:22:16.880
I see...

01:22:18.080 --> 01:22:20.380
You're definitely not a terrorist.

01:22:46.630 --> 01:22:47.830
Take her away!

01:22:48.000 --> 01:22:49.210
Yes, sir!

01:22:54.170 --> 01:22:55.170
General!

01:22:55.170 --> 01:22:58.170
Mobs are rising up all over the city
in response to the attacks!

01:22:58.170 --> 01:23:01.920
Heavy infantry units are out
suppressing them as we speak, but...

01:23:07.210 --> 01:23:08.630
Man, it's hot!

01:23:08.630 --> 01:23:11.080
Inside or out, it's all the same!

01:23:13.170 --> 01:23:14.710
If only we could shoot something!

01:23:14.710 --> 01:23:16.580
Get away from me! You smell!

01:23:17.290 --> 01:23:18.500
Hey there...

01:23:19.250 --> 01:23:20.790
lonely boy.

01:23:21.330 --> 01:23:22.920
What're you thinking about?

01:23:22.920 --> 01:23:25.080
Some cutie pie waiting for you back home?

01:23:25.330 --> 01:23:26.750
What does it matter to you?!

01:23:27.080 --> 01:23:28.080
Oh, feisty!

01:23:28.420 --> 01:23:32.460
I mean, we're getting close to Io, right?

01:23:32.750 --> 01:23:33.960
Io?

01:23:33.960 --> 01:23:35.710
Huh? Didn't you know?

01:23:36.750 --> 01:23:38.500
We're defenders of justice!

01:23:38.500 --> 01:23:41.580
"Hang in there, Io dear!
We're coming for you!"

01:23:41.880 --> 01:23:43.210
07!

01:23:44.290 --> 01:23:46.000
That's you!

01:23:46.420 --> 01:23:49.000
The Capt'n needs you!
Get to his office right now!

01:23:50.040 --> 01:23:51.460
You'd better watch out.

01:23:51.460 --> 01:23:52.960
The Capt'n is into this!

01:23:53.540 --> 01:23:54.750
That's what you're into.

01:23:54.750 --> 01:23:55.830
Isn't that right?!

01:23:55.830 --> 01:23:56.960
Cut it out!

01:24:00.540 --> 01:24:01.830
Is that you, 07?

01:24:05.670 --> 01:24:07.750
Come in! What are you waiting for?

01:24:12.250 --> 01:24:14.670
You've passed Jeff's lectures, right?

01:24:15.580 --> 01:24:17.420
Give your vehicle a once-over.

01:24:17.420 --> 01:24:20.210
We head into battle as soon as we arrive.

01:24:20.210 --> 01:24:21.630
When we get to Io?

01:24:22.080 --> 01:24:23.330
That's right.

01:24:25.880 --> 01:24:27.130
Does that make you happy?

01:24:28.130 --> 01:24:29.670
But don't you desert us.

01:24:29.670 --> 01:24:32.000
We made a deal, man to man.

01:24:32.000 --> 01:24:34.750
Show your buddies how you can take out an Octopus.

01:24:34.750 --> 01:24:36.000
And don't even think...

01:24:37.330 --> 01:24:39.420
about shooting me from behind.

01:24:42.330 --> 01:24:45.170
Back there, you aimed for my head.

01:24:45.710 --> 01:24:48.250
The back of the seat is bulletproof.

01:24:48.630 --> 01:24:49.880
Did you know that?

01:24:50.500 --> 01:24:51.710
No.

01:24:57.000 --> 01:24:58.750
You're really something.

01:24:58.920 --> 01:25:00.250
Tell you what:

01:25:00.250 --> 01:25:02.420
Whenever you see an Octopus, pretend it's me!

01:25:02.420 --> 01:25:03.420
"Die!"

01:25:03.420 --> 01:25:04.960
That's what you think when you shoot.

01:25:05.290 --> 01:25:07.460
Do that, and you'll win.

01:25:14.210 --> 01:25:15.920
We'll secure the cosmoport!

01:25:15.920 --> 01:25:17.330
Send over the troops in the north!

01:25:17.330 --> 01:25:18.920
Destroy the city!

01:25:18.920 --> 01:25:21.540
Leave them nothing but rubble to retake!

01:25:29.040 --> 01:25:30.250
The cosmoport!

01:25:30.580 --> 01:25:34.420
It's the only place their unwieldy crafts can dock!

01:25:34.670 --> 01:25:36.080
We'll capture this!

01:25:36.710 --> 01:25:38.710
Then they have no means of escape!

01:25:39.330 --> 01:25:40.670
Open the tailgate!

01:25:40.670 --> 01:25:42.960
Outta the way!
Charlie Squadron gets to go first!

01:25:42.960 --> 01:25:44.460
But you're still getting adjustments!

01:25:44.460 --> 01:25:46.920
Ito's squadron goes first! Go!

01:25:54.670 --> 01:25:55.670
Hey!

01:25:56.080 --> 01:25:58.080
Come back alive, okay, baby?

01:25:58.960 --> 01:26:01.630
Chris, are you ducking your duties again?

01:26:01.920 --> 01:26:03.830
I think you mean, "fucking your dudes."

01:26:07.500 --> 01:26:11.250
The Hounds are all dispensable.
It's stupid to be in a hurry to die.

01:26:11.500 --> 01:26:13.330
Though I guess you can rise up the ranks,

01:26:13.330 --> 01:26:16.130
but not any higher than an NCO.

01:26:16.960 --> 01:26:18.830
Sure, I love these babies, though.

01:26:19.210 --> 01:26:21.330
You know how you let loose the railgun?

01:26:21.330 --> 01:26:22.330
Boom!

01:26:22.500 --> 01:26:24.250
Sexy, isn't it?

01:26:25.750 --> 01:26:28.000
I just can't get enough of that!

01:26:28.000 --> 01:26:29.210
07!

01:26:30.830 --> 01:26:32.460
All good! Let's go!

01:27:10.290 --> 01:27:11.710
Attention rear troops!

01:27:11.960 --> 01:27:14.380
We have complete control of the cosmoport!

01:27:14.710 --> 01:27:16.130
Tighten up your ranks!

01:27:16.250 --> 01:27:17.460
Fight!

01:27:17.580 --> 01:27:22.710
This battle will go down in history
as a record of our glory!

01:27:23.130 --> 01:27:25.380
Ishtar is invincible, men!

01:27:36.040 --> 01:27:38.210
General, we're surrounded!

01:27:38.210 --> 01:27:40.170
Order the troops to withdraw!

01:27:50.460 --> 01:27:51.830
Assume formation alpha!

01:27:51.830 --> 01:27:53.040
On to the next target!

01:27:55.920 --> 01:27:56.920
Here comes one!

01:27:56.920 --> 01:27:57.960
It's 26!

01:27:57.960 --> 01:27:59.330
Is that Manuel?

01:28:01.040 --> 01:28:03.080
Back so soon, huh?!

01:28:03.080 --> 01:28:04.500
Douse the right side!

01:28:04.500 --> 01:28:07.210
Forget the smoke, just reload the thing!

01:28:07.330 --> 01:28:08.040
The side's all damaged!

01:28:08.040 --> 01:28:09.500
Check the gyro! Hurry!

01:28:08.580 --> 01:28:09.880
Get a spare! Quick!

01:28:09.500 --> 01:28:11.460
Another one's on its way!

01:28:09.880 --> 01:28:11.460
Hey, open up a vent!

01:28:11.460 --> 01:28:12.630
Put out that fire!

01:28:12.630 --> 01:28:13.460
Stand back! Don't breath it in!

01:28:13.460 --> 01:28:14.790
Outta the chair!

01:28:14.130 --> 01:28:14.790
Where are the others when you need them?!

01:28:16.290 --> 01:28:18.330
47's coming in! It's on fire!

01:28:18.500 --> 01:28:19.710
Why, you...

01:28:29.210 --> 01:28:30.380
Fall back!

01:28:30.380 --> 01:28:32.000
Get off the ridge!

01:28:45.000 --> 01:28:46.420
Hanako got hit!

01:28:50.500 --> 01:28:52.670
We gotta get revenge, 07!

01:29:01.830 --> 01:29:03.040
That's the one!

01:29:03.420 --> 01:29:04.630
Get it!

01:29:10.710 --> 01:29:12.130
They're better than they look.

01:29:47.920 --> 01:29:49.130
Who's that?!

01:29:51.330 --> 01:29:52.580
Is it 07?!

01:29:52.830 --> 01:29:54.040
It's Hiro!

01:29:54.130 --> 01:29:55.460
So 07, right?!

01:29:55.750 --> 01:29:57.380
"Hiro," the battlebike rider!

01:30:00.880 --> 01:30:02.080
Damn!

01:30:04.500 --> 01:30:05.710
Don't let him get away!

01:30:05.710 --> 01:30:06.920
Y-yes, sir.

01:30:09.500 --> 01:30:10.710
After him!

01:30:13.170 --> 01:30:15.080
Damn your little toys!

01:30:43.960 --> 01:30:45.210
Run!

01:30:46.130 --> 01:30:48.460
Forget the monobike!
Leave it and go!

01:30:52.000 --> 01:30:54.210
Hurry up and run, idiot!

01:31:03.670 --> 01:31:05.000
I got him!

01:31:05.710 --> 01:31:06.920
Move!

01:31:09.420 --> 01:31:10.830
How dare you?

01:31:11.250 --> 01:31:13.170
Impudent trooper!

01:32:00.920 --> 01:32:03.080
General, order the retreat! Hurry!

01:32:03.080 --> 01:32:05.040
We'll lose all our cargo shi-

01:32:10.420 --> 01:32:12.500
I won't take this insult!

01:32:14.000 --> 01:32:18.130
Our invincible armored brigade
conquered Io in a single day!

01:32:22.580 --> 01:32:24.420
You dare confront us, scum?!

01:33:06.330 --> 01:33:08.380
G-General!

01:33:08.500 --> 01:33:10.580
Full power! Pull us up!

01:34:19.540 --> 01:34:23.130
Although there is some sporadic resistance
going on around Io City,

01:34:23.420 --> 01:34:25.830
we should suppress them before long.

01:34:26.380 --> 01:34:30.290
As for the whereabouts and fate of the
enemy commander, General Donner,

01:34:30.290 --> 01:34:33.210
we are currently investigating the matter.

01:34:36.000 --> 01:34:38.960
I don't blame you; the city's right there.

01:34:39.330 --> 01:34:43.170
Besides, even if I said no you'd still leave.

01:34:43.790 --> 01:34:45.420
I can see it in your eyes.

01:34:49.750 --> 01:34:50.960
Hold on!

01:34:52.000 --> 01:34:54.250
They destroyed your monobike, right?

01:34:54.960 --> 01:34:56.670
I'll lend you mine.

01:34:56.790 --> 01:34:59.710
But dismount the railgun first.

01:34:59.920 --> 01:35:02.130
You won't be running into an Octopus again.

01:35:09.210 --> 01:35:11.500
I hear he's got quite the potential.

01:35:11.880 --> 01:35:13.500
Think he'll be back?

01:35:15.170 --> 01:35:16.380
Probably.

01:35:42.960 --> 01:35:44.460
No stopping!

01:35:44.710 --> 01:35:45.960
One by one!

01:35:45.960 --> 01:35:47.130
Okay, next!

01:35:48.040 --> 01:35:49.830
You can talk later. Hurry!

01:35:50.460 --> 01:35:51.750
Squeeze in!

01:35:52.540 --> 01:35:54.330
Look, we don't have all day!

01:35:58.750 --> 01:36:00.460
Come on, keep moving!

01:36:03.250 --> 01:36:04.920
You're going to Io?

01:36:05.960 --> 01:36:07.830
I saw Cathy there.

01:36:07.830 --> 01:36:09.710
She told me about Maggie!

01:36:10.580 --> 01:36:11.790
Come on!

01:36:12.170 --> 01:36:13.920
You want to see her, right?

01:36:14.250 --> 01:36:16.130
Apparently she's in the Bellevue refugee camp!

01:36:16.130 --> 01:36:17.380
Move along!

01:36:20.210 --> 01:36:22.170
Are you going back to Earth?

01:36:23.380 --> 01:36:25.210
Yes, probably!

01:36:25.420 --> 01:36:27.960
Remember, Maggie's at the Bellevue refugee camp!

01:36:28.210 --> 01:36:29.420
Take care!

01:36:29.830 --> 01:36:32.960
You too, Hiro!

01:36:38.880 --> 01:36:41.540
Yokubou sae

01:36:38.880 --> 01:36:41.540
Be it desire

01:36:41.830 --> 01:36:44.500
Zetsubou sae

01:36:41.830 --> 01:36:44.500
Be it despair

01:36:44.920 --> 01:36:48.170
Shiranaimama ja

01:36:44.920 --> 01:36:48.170
If you haven't experienced it

01:36:51.000 --> 01:36:56.670
Kako to mirai tsunagu hazu no

01:36:51.000 --> 01:36:56.670
You'll never see the present

01:36:57.040 --> 01:37:01.080
Ima ga mienai

01:36:57.040 --> 01:37:01.080
