Ushinau mono mo nai

01:37:41.250 --> 01:37:44.170
You have nothing to lose

01:37:44.670 --> 01:37:50.170
Wakasa no ogori ga kirameku senaka

01:37:44.670 --> 01:37:50.170
Your back glows with the hubris of youth

01:37:50.170 --> 01:37:52.080
What do you hound on?

01:37:53.250 --> 01:37:56.130
Butsukeru mono mo nai

01:37:53.250 --> 01:37:56.130
You have nothing to strike with

01:37:56.790 --> 01:37:59.710
Samayou kokoro o chigitte

01:37:56.790 --> 01:37:59.710
Tear up your wandering soul and

01:37:59.710 --> 01:38:02.920
Ride & Crush

01:38:02.920 --> 01:38:06.330
Crush & Ride

01:38:06.330 --> 01:38:10.960
Hashirinukeru

01:38:06.330 --> 01:38:10.960
Keep riding through

01:38:12.380 --> 01:38:17.580
Hashirinukeru

01:38:12.380 --> 01:38:17.580
Keep riding through

01:38:30.500 --> 01:38:39.710
